---
const outcomes = [
  "Identify FVGs, order blocks, liquidity sweeps",
  "Build a daily bias from HTF to LTF",
  "Validate setups with a structured checklist",
  "Recognize all 4 stages of price delivery",
  "Use kill zones and session context",
  "Detect SMT divergence for confluence",
];
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-slate-950/30 to-black"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-1/3 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-500/[0.04] rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <p class="text-brand-400 text-sm font-medium tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">Learning Outcomes</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What You'll Be Able to Do</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        By the end of this course, these concepts won't just be familiar &mdash; they'll be second nature.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 stagger-children">
      {outcomes.map((outcome) => (
        <div class="animate-on-scroll flex items-start gap-3 border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-white/[0.1] transition-all">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">{outcome}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
